# Authorship note: adds Tofik Israfilov as co-author. The published deposits
# (SSRN 6147567, Zenodo v2.0.1 and v3.0.0) are sole-authored and stay that way --
# this change takes effect from the next deposit onward.
#
# VERSION IDENTIFIERS DISAGREED ACROSS FILES before this branch, and the
# reconciliation is still the author's to confirm:
#   paper/alpha-asymmetry.tex  carried \paperver 3.0.0 for the July 2026
#                              manuscript (set in f04ae08, 21 Jul 2026)
#   this file                  called the same work v2.1.0-dev
#   last DEPOSITED version     is v3.0.0 (Zenodo record 21315494,
#                              10.5281/zenodo.21315494, published 11 Jul 2026;
#                              verified against the Zenodo API 6 Oct 2026)
# 2.1.0-dev was never deposited. v3.0.0 carries strategy figures from code whose
# exit rule did not match the specification; this branch supersedes them.
#
# v3.1.0-dev = the present correction pass: holding rule, execution lag and
# asymmetry index corrected against the published specification; all downstream
# results regenerated, plus the Reviewer 3 response. Follows the .tex numbering
# because that is the identifier printed on the paper itself. Not yet deposited.
# Depositing mints a new Zenodo version DOI, which should be recorded here and
# in CLAUDE.md afterwards; the SSRN record requires a separate revision.
